        // the level objects it destroys are this pass's locals, released at the pass's end, and the
        // renderer's state is the play window's, closed at the resume. The body below is not re-indented.
        // Checkpoint 132ob6 (port-only): the CPU partner setting, read after the front end (its "CPU Partner" row may have
