                // at 0024519c. The play frame then runs the render pass 00132e50 (0x00169048; its HUD draw
                // 00244b90 at 0x00133110) and only after it the text manager draw 003d0c10 (0x001690dc), which
                // advances each listed text object's state (003cfab0) on its draw clock: the world clock after
